# Alhaitham Xingqiu Aino Ineffa. ~22s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Long field time Alhaitham. ~27% Quicken uptime; Alhaitham combo focuses on driving rainswords. Ineffa FoPL > Aubade.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
alhaitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
